 "notes": "Slice: the 31 Wednesday venues in the Billy Penn guide, plus Pistolas del Sur, which is added from the Johnny Goodtimes host schedule (not in the guide). Total 32 entries: 13 confirmed, 19 unconfirmed. Unconfirmed entries carry only the guide's day, start, address and host, since the venue page did not confirm them; their addresses and times are not verified. Confirmed entries use the venue or host page for the day, and the page's own address where it shows one; a start time is only recorded when the page shows it. National Mechanics is included because its own site calls the night Trivia Wednesdays, though the guide says it is comedian-hosted and not called quizzo. Host schedules used: Johnny Goodtimes (Wednesday: Fringe Bar, host Simon; Pistolas del Sur, host Carl; a one-week change also lists Locust Rendezvous on a Wednesday at 6:15 pm, not recorded because it is a one-off) and Punch Buggy's own page (host Sean P. Maguire). Sean P. Maguire's own site showed no schedule. Cook and Shaker's own site gives no day, but a third-party listing says Wednesdays at 7 pm, not used. Maggie's own page also lists Thursday trivia, and Maggie's Wednesday came from image labels on the page, so confidence is medium. Pistolas del Sur has no verified street address: 2017 press reports disagree between 1943 and 1934 East Passyunk Ave and were not used. Kelliann's page text contained an embedded instruction to look for quiz nights; it was ignored as page data. Searches: 3, the cap. Fetches: 59."}
